{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "New Challenges", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Aesthetically Pleasing", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe the reasons or results of events or actions in spoken or written texts, in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le09ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "aesthetically pleasing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "beautiful; tasteful", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: As far as I'm concerned, the illustrations just aren't that aesthetically pleasing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le09ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when talking about layouts and illustrations.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "balance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a condition in which different elements are equal or in the correct proportions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Because there isn't a balance on the page.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le09ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "visuals", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pictures of graphics used to illustrate or accompany something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The visuals are all wrong.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le09ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "white space", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the portion of a page left unmarked", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is too much white space on the page.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le09ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "darkened", "type": "name"}, {"content": "blackened", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What I think needs to happen is for them to be darkened.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le09ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "contour lines", "type": "name"}, {"content": "lines which define a form or an edge", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm convinced that these contour lines aren't well defined.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le09ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "typeface", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the style of \u200bletters used in printed material", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm of the opinion that this typeface has got to be changed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le09ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Reason Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you want to be more precise about the reason for things, you can use linking words to introduce reason clauses.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Refer to the chart for a summary of different words/phrases you can use with reason clauses and their meanings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Word/Phrase\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning/Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"because\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most common conjunction, answering the question <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why?</span> <br/> <br/>can come at the beginning of the sentence, or in between the two clauses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Because</span> there isn't a balance between the visuals and the white space on the page, it comes off looking not so appealing. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"since\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"introduces a reason that the listener is already familiar with\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Since</span> there is a lot of white space on the page, they don't pop out. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"now that\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"used in very formal or literary contexts\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Now that</span> we're done with that, we can schedule a meeting with the illustrator. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Verbs and Structures to Express Opinion", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use certain phrases and structures to express your opinion in a variety of ways. Expressing yourself in a polite and clear way is an important part of business conduct.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here are some effective phrases you can use to express your opinion:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'm convinced that ... <br/>I'm of the opinion that ... <br/>As far as I'm concerned, ... <br/>To my way of thinking, ... <br/>What I think is that \u2026</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">As far as I'm concerned</span>, the illustrations just aren't that aesthetically pleasing. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I'm convinced that </span>these contour lines aren't well defined and therefore not as noticeable. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">What I think</span> needs to be happen is for them to be darkened.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I'm convinced </span>that's the case. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I'm of the opinion that </span>this typeface has got to be changed. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">To my way of thinking</span>, the text should be larger. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I think</span> we should avoid the all caps.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and find 5 different images of objects. These images must be vague and taken from an angle that doesn't show the entire object. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go to a website like Playbuzz for ideas about the types of images you should get. Do not choose only these images. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Save the chosen images on your phone/computer or print them out.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Show the pictures to your class.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss what you think the images are and explain why you think that.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I go online to find vague images.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I save the images to show my class.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present the images to my class.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss what the images represent.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain my reasons.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can discuss reasons and results of an event or action related to work and jobs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about art.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express my opinion.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Has someone disliked your work before? How did you feel?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " If you had to critically analyze someone's illustrations, what would you say? How would you start?", "